--[[
Roblox Client Inspector
------------------------
Features:
• Floating draggable button
• Draggable inspector window
• Search Instances / Classes / Attributes / Values
• Lazy-loaded Instance tree
• Attribute viewer
• Live DescendantAdded detection
• Rescan
• Expand All / Collapse All
• JSON export
• Instance limit + yielding for performance

This does NOT bypass Roblox replication/security.
]]

